            "text_8VFYxP": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Hi, I’m Jules.</p><p>A few years ago, I was a shelter dog waiting for someone to give me a chance.</p><p>I’m a pit bull, and sometimes people make up their minds about dogs like me before they ever get to know us.</p><p>Luckily, one family looked past all of that.</p><p>They didn’t see a breed.</p><p>They saw me.</p><p>They brought me home, gave me a family, and changed my life forever.</p>",
