          "blocks": {
            "text_yKtJaM": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Today, I’m not a shelter dog anymore.</p><p>I’m a spoiled family dog, a best friend, and even a baseball pup.</p><p>I go to the baseball field to watch my human brother play, and apparently I’ve become pretty popular. People show up and ask:</p><p>“Where’s Jules?”</p><p>Some people who weren’t sure about pit bulls before meeting me have gotten to know me and discovered something my family already knew:</p><p>Sometimes the dogs people misunderstand the most just need someone willing to give them a chance.</p><p>And that’s a big part of why my family created PS4PETS.</p><p>They’ve rescued dogs like me and know firsthand how much love shelter animals have to give.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
